    fix(build): let Workbox keep the single content-derived shell entry (ORD-0268)
    
    additionalManifestEntries named the shell a second time as "/index.html" with a revision that
    never changes, next to the generated "index.html" entry whose revision does change per build. With
    both in one manifest, Workbox's precache never materialised on a real client: CacheStorage stayed
    empty through install, a generation swap and an offline revisit, so the offline shell the config
    promises was never there to serve.
    
    Measured in the shape the order asked for: control round (line still present) - no precache cache at
    any step and the offline navigation ends in the browser's own ERR_CONNECTION_REFUSED; fixed round -
    the workbox-precache cache appears and the same offline navigation is answered by the worker with the
    new generation's asset.

